WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.534
Pascal for Nova, from Swipht Group.

00:02.534 --> 00:10.498
Open a Pascal or Object Pascal file, and Nova highlights it, with a symbol list for your classes and routines.

00:10.498 --> 00:16.073
Save, and Free Pascal checks your code, so errors appear right in the editor.

00:16.073 --> 00:19.548
Build, run, and clean from the Free Pascal task.

00:19.548 --> 00:24.037
Format with ptop, and start new programs and units from clips.

00:24.037 --> 00:25.919
It needs Nova 11 or later.

00:25.919 --> 00:28.960
Find Pascal in the Nova Extension Library.

